This is an enterprise Real World Asset (RWA) tokenization and PropTech ERP platform condensed into two bullet points.

Building an end-to-end lifecycle system (Land $\rightarrow$ Build $\rightarrow$ Manage) combined with a fractional liquidity layer (Tokenization) requires bridging three distinct software disciplines: **traditional real estate ERP**, **IoT/operations management**, and **Web3 asset tokenization**.

Here is the architectural decomposition, module breakdown, and technical realities needed to scope this project properly.

