### 3. Recommended Architecture & Tech Stack

| Component | Technology | Rationale |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Mobile Apps** | Flutter or React Native | Cross-platform parity across iOS/Android for investors, site managers, and tenants. |
| **Backend Core** | NestJS (Node.js/TypeScript) or Go | Modular service architecture suited for complex relational business logic and event management. |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB | ACID compliance for financial ledgers; time-series data for construction and facility IoT logs. |
| **Blockchain / L2** | Polygon, Arbitrum, or Base | Low gas fees for micro-distributions of rent and fractional transfers; Ethereum ecosystem tooling. |
| **Contract Framework** | Solidity + Foundry / Hardhat | Security token standards with role-based access control and upgradable proxy patterns (UUPS). |
| **Storage** | AWS S3 + IPFS / Arweave | S3 for standard operational docs; IPFS/Arweave for permanent, decentralized custody of title deeds and audit certificates. |

